@startuml GoldPlanner_WorldQuests_Sequence
title GoldPlanner - World Quest Event Sequence

actor "WoW Client" as WoW
participant "UI.WorldQuests" as UIWQ
participant "Activities.WorldQuests" as ActivitiesWQ

WoW -> UIWQ : QUEST_LOG_UPDATE
activate UIWQ
UIWQ -> ActivitiesWQ : ResolvePendingRewards()
activate ActivitiesWQ
ActivitiesWQ --> UIWQ : rewards resolved
deactivate ActivitiesWQ

UIWQ -> UIWQ : RequestUpdate()
UIWQ -> UIWQ : C_Timer.After(0)
UIWQ -> ActivitiesWQ : ScanAll()
activate ActivitiesWQ
ActivitiesWQ --> UIWQ : world quest data
deactivate ActivitiesWQ
UIWQ -> UIWQ : Update()
deactivate UIWQ

note over WoW,ActivitiesWQ
This is intentionally a local UI flow.
No WORLD_QUESTS_UPDATED custom event is needed:
the UI owns the Blizzard event and the tightly
coupled activity refresh.
end note
@enduml
